      "id": "claim_060ff747536647329a1c5a411fe97c50",
      "statement": "rewrite() changes only the model and effort lines in the leading frontmatter: it replaces an existing line in place, inserts a missing one after the last description/tools/model key, deletes a line whose value is none, and leaves unchanged files unwritten.",
